'' RUN: 'iif( CONST, a, b )' is the chosen arm, folded before typing as fbc folds it: string
'' and number arms are fine then, the type is the arm's, and the other arm is not
'' evaluated (audit F-70). Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/iif-const-fold.bas -o tests/codegen/iifconstfold.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/iifconstfold.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: a
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7 2.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
